resses an issue with the parsing of the Location header when handling HTTP status codes 301 or 302.\r\n\r\n### Problem:\r\nPreviously, headers with a name matching the pattern *-location (e.g., X-location, My-location) were incorrectly interpreted as redirect targets. This caused unintended behavior when following redirects.\r\n\r\n### Fix:\r\nUpdated the logic to only recognize the standard Location header (case-insensitive) for determining redirect URLs in 301/302 responses.\r\n\r\nReference:\r\nhttps://http.dev/redirects\r\n\r\n* *Bugsquad edit, fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102960*","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":391232995,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzOTEyMzI5OTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:assetlib","name":"topic:assetlib","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":7008779076,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABocF7RA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.3","name":"cherrypick:4.3","description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.3.x release","color":"446699","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8089024095,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB4iS2Xw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.4","name":"cherrypick:4.4","description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.4.x release","color":"446699","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"htt